                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \{0\lt 1\cdots\lt n\}
              forces each
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi t
                      %mi i
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} t_i
              to be stable.
            %li
              In the
              %em orbit case
